<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>Krishna National Contest 2026</title>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a237e 0%, #0d47a1 50%, #01579b 100%);
            color: #fff;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Animated background pattern */
        body::before {
            content: '';
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(circle at 20% 50%, rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.1) 0%, transparent 50%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 80% 80%, rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.1) 0%, transparent 50%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 40% 90%, rgba(33, 150, 243, 0.1) 0%, transparent 50%);
            animation: float 20s ease-in-out infinite;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        @keyframes float {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 0.5; transform: translateY(0); }
            50% { opacity: 0.8; transform: translateY(-20px); }
        }

        .navbar {
            background: rgba(21, 32, 66, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            padding: 18px 0;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .navbar-content {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 30px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd700 0%, #ffb300 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .logo::before {
            content: '🕉️';
            font-size: 28px;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffd700;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 30px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            padding: 8px 20px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.1);
            color: #ffd700;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .nav-links a.btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd700 0%, #ffb300 100%);
            color: #1a237e;
            font-weight: 600;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .nav-links a.btn-primary:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 6px 25px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.5);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        /* Mobile menu toggle */
        .menu-toggle {
            display: none;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .menu-toggle span {
            width: 25px;
            height: 3px;
            background: #ffd700;
            border-radius: 3px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 120px 30px 100px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 56px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd700 0%, #fff 50%, #ffd700 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            animation: shimmer 3s ease-in-out infinite;
            text-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3);
        }

        @keyframes shimmer {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
            50% { opacity: 0.8; }
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            color: #e3f2fd;
            font-weight: 300;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #ffd700;
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 16px 45px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd700 0%, #ffb300 100%);
            color: #1a237e;
            font-weight: 600;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 30px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 18px;
            text-decoration: none;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 25px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.4);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .btn::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            width: 0;
            height: 0;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            transition: width 0.6s, height 0.6s;
        }

        .btn:hover::before {
            width: 300px;
            height: 300px;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 35px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.6);
        }

        .section {
            padding: 80px 30px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .section h2 {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 42px;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            color: #ffd700;
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
        }

        .section h2::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -10px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 80px;
            height: 4px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #ffd700, transparent);
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.2);
            padding: 35px 30px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 4px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ffd700, #ffb300, #ffd700);
            transform: translateX(-100%);
            transition: transform 0.6s ease;
        }

        .card:hover::before {
            transform: translateX(0);
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            border-color: #ffd700;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: #ffd700;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 24px;
        }

        .card p {
            color: #e3f2fd;
            line-height: 1.7;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .about-section {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border-radius: 25px;
            padding: 60px 50px;
            margin: 60px auto;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.15);
        }

        .about-section p {
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #e3f2fd;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .footer {
            background: rgba(13, 19, 38, 0.95);
            padding: 50px 30px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 80px;
            border-top: 2px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.2);
        }

        .footer-content {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .footer p {
            margin: 12px 0;
            color: #b0bec5;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .footer a {
            color: #ffd700;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            padding: 5px 10px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        .footer a:hover {
            color: #fff;
            background: rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .footer-links {
            margin: 25px 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        /* Responsive Design */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .menu-toggle {
                display: flex;
            }

            .nav-links {
                position: fixed;
                top: 70px;
                right: -100%;
                background: rgba(21, 32, 66, 0.98);
                backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
                flex-direction: column;
                width: 250px;
                padding: 30px;
                border-radius: 0 0 0 20px;
                box-shadow: -5px 5px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
                transition: right 0.4s ease;
            }

            .nav-links.active {
                right: 0;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 36px;
            }

            .hero p {
                font-size: 18px;
            }

            .section h2 {
                font-size: 32px;
            }

            .cards {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .about-section {
                padding: 40px 30px;
            }

            .footer-links {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 10px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .navbar-content {
                padding: 0 20px;
            }

            .logo {
                font-size: 18px;
            }

            .hero {
                padding: 80px 20px 60px;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 28px;
            }

            .hero p {
                font-size: 16px;
            }

            .btn {
                padding: 14px 35px;
                font-size: 16px;
            }

            .section {
                padding: 50px 20px;
            }

            .section h2 {
                font-size: 26px;
            }

            .card {
                padding: 25px 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav class="navbar">
        <div class="navbar-content">
            <div class="logo">Krishna National Contest 2026</div>
            <div class="menu-toggle" onclick="toggleMenu()">
                <span></span>
                <span></span>
                <span></span>
            </div>
            <div class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
                <a href="/">Home</a>
                <a href="/about">About</a>
                <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
                <a href="/login">Login</a>
                <a href="/register" class="btn-primary">Register Now</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="hero">
        <h1>Krishna National Contest 2026</h1>
        <p>Celebrating Devotion, Creativity & Culture</p>
        <div class="hero-subtitle">Join thousands in this spiritual celebration</div>
        <a href="/register">
            <button class="btn">Participate Now</button>
        </a>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>Contest Categories</h2>
        <div class="cards">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>🎨 Krishna Painting Contest</h3>
                <p>Express your devotion through vibrant art and creativity. Share your vision of Lord Krishna's divine leelas.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>📖 Bhagavad Gita Essay</h3>
                <p>Share your understanding and insights from the timeless wisdom of the Bhagavad Gita.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>🎵 Devotional Singing</h3>
                <p>Offer your heartfelt bhajans and kirtans. Let your voice celebrate the glory of Krishna.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <div class="about-section">
            <h2>About The Organizer</h2>
            <p>
                Organized by the <strong>International Society for Krishna Consciousness (ISKCON)</strong>, 
                this national contest aims to promote devotional culture, spiritual education, and creative 
                expression across India. Join us in celebrating the timeless teachings and divine pastimes 
                of Lord Krishna.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="footer">
        <div class="footer-content">
            <p><strong>International Society for Krishna Consciousness (ISKCON)</strong></p>
            <p>Email: support@krishnacontest.org | Phone: +91-XXXXXXXXXX</p>
            <div class="footer-links">
                <a href="/about">About</a>
                <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
                <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>
                <a href="/terms">Terms & Conditions</a>
                <a href="/refund-policy">Refund Policy</a>
            </div>
            <p style="margin-top: 25px; color: #78909c;">© 2026 Krishna National Contest. All Rights Reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script>
        function toggleMenu() {
            const navLinks = document.getElementById('navLinks');
            navLinks.classList.toggle('active');
        }

        // Close menu when clicking outside
        document.addEventListener('click', function(event) {
            const navLinks = document.getElementById('navLinks');
            const menuToggle = document.querySelector('.menu-toggle');
            
            if (!navLinks.contains(event.target) && !menuToggle.contains(event.target)) {
                navLinks.classList.remove('active');
            }
        });
    </script>

</body>
</html>
